#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/mayhem/page/sections.js
msgid "On: the remote servers get the query together and the first good answer counts, so a server that does not answer slows nothing down. By lists or with FakeDNS the provider's DNS gets the names of proxied sites too. Off (fallback): the servers are asked one after another, the next one after 2 s without an answer."
